            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Old and new findings on development and regression of the nervous system in relation to brain plasticity are presented as deafferentiation phenomena in the sensory, nociceptive, visual and auditory systems. Other applications of the deafferentiation concept are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
